Older government supplier records corroborate the same Constantia Park address, pointing to a long-standing presence at this location. Together, these independent sources confirm both the nature of Ibhubesi''s business as an IT products and services provider and its base of operations, making it a verified supplier of IT hardware and technology products to businesses and organisations in the Pretoria area.', description_enriched_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'ibhubesi-information-technologies-cc-constantia-park' AND description = 'An IT consultancy, sales and service company in Constantia Park founded in 2002, a black economic empowerment company providing computer and networking equipment sales, support and services.' AND description_enriched_at IS NULL AND length(COALESCE(description, '')) < 700
