UPDATE businesses SET description = 'Ingwane Company SA (Pty) Ltd is a one-stop business-services provider based in Capital View, Pretoria, assisting small and medium enterprises and entrepreneurs with company administration, compliance, accounting, tax and digital services. The company was registered with the Companies and Intellectual Property Commission (CIPC) in 2018, and its service model is built around supporting SMMEs from initial business registration through to ongoing compliance and operational support.

