Ingwane Company SA operates from 8367 Cashmere Street, Capital View Security Estate, Pretoria, during weekday business hours of 08:00 to 16:00. Its combination of statutory compliance services, accounting support and digital services is aimed at entrepreneurs and SMMEs that need ongoing assistance navigating regulatory requirements while running their businesses.', description_enriched_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'ingwane-company-sa-pty-ltd-brakfontein' AND description = 'A one-stop consulting firm in Brakfontein registered in 2018, helping small and medium enterprises with company registration, BEE compliance, tax and bookkeeping, and website design and SEO.' AND description_enriched_at IS NULL AND length(COALESCE(description, '')) < 700
